Example 1:
Input: @ints = (-1, -2, -3, -4, 3, 2, 1)
Output: 1
The product -1 × -2 × -3 × -4 × 3 × 2 × 1 => 144 > 0

Example 2:
Input: @ints = (1, 2, 0, -2, -1)
Output: 0
The product 1 × 2 × 0 × -2 × -1 => 0

Example 3:
Input: @ints = (-1, -1, 1, -1, 2)
Output: -1
The product -1 × -1 × 1 × -1 × 2 => -2 < 0
